  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Counterproliferation Program (ICP): Proliferation and Terrorism Course</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Proliferation Pathways and Terrorism course was delivered to 22 participants from the Ministry of Interior, Ministry of Defense, State Agency for National Security (SANS), Ministry of Finance, and Prosecutors Office. The course provided participants an opportunity to expand awareness of state and non-state actor proliferation in order to examine key differences in scale and intent; to examine the global threat of terrorism and WMD and the linkage between terrorist groups and WMD; and to develop proficiency in developing counterproliferation and counterterrorism operations and policies.</narrative>
  </description>
